{"id": "4f599e45-cdb3-4667-965a-de186cd57dfa", "slug": "vortex-global-scale-1", "title": "Vortex - Global Scale", "description": "Vortex Global Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-staff-featured-2026-05-22\"\nname: \"Vortex - Global Scale\"\ndescription: \"Vortex Global Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#10B981\"\n  secondary: \"#8E939A\"\n  accent: \"#FBBF24\"\n  background: \"#101215\"\n  surface: \"#8E939A\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#8E939A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Geist\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"4px\"\n  control: \"4px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Vortex - Global Scale\nSource: Neuform staff featured templates. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 262; favorites: 11; remixes: 6.\nTags: login, animated, input, validation, effect, security.\n## Overview\nVortex Global Login Section is designed for authenticating users through a focused access flow. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for authentication screens in web products.\n\nVortex Solutions Industries Developers Pricing Sign In Try for Free Ship Globally in Milliseconds Distribute your applications worldwide instantly with our ultra-fast edge infrastructure. Everything you need to develop,…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Ship Globally in Milliseconds.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #10B981, secondary #8E939A, accent #FBBF24, background #101215, surface #8E939A, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Geist for display moments and Geist for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\"><head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Vortex - Global Scale</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n<link id=\"all-fonts-link-font-geist\" rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@300;400;500;600;700&amp;display=swap\"><style id=\"all-fonts-style-font-geist\">.font-geist { font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif !important; }</style></head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#101215] min-h-screen flex flex-col font-sans antialiased overflow-hidden text-slate-200 relative m-0\">\n\n    <!-- Header Navigation -->\n    <header class=\"absolute top-0 inset-x-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-between px-6 py-6 lg:px-12 w-full max-w-[1440px] mx-auto pointer-events-auto\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\">\n            <div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center shadow-md\">\n                <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-cyan-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(34,211,238,0.8)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n            <span class=\"text-white font-medium text-[16px] tracking-tight font-geist\">Vortex</span>\n        </div>\n        <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#8e939a] hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Solutions</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#8e939a] hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Industries</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#8e939a] hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Developers</a>\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-[13px] font-medium text-[#8e939a] hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Pricing</a>\n        </nav>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\">\n            <a href=\"#\" class=\"hidden md:block text-[13px] font-medium text-[#8e939a] hover:text-white transition-colors font-geist\">Sign In</a>\n            <button class=\"bg-[#1a1d24] hover:bg-[#22262f] text-white px-5 py-2 rounded-full text-[13px] font-medium border border-white/5 transition-all font-geist\">\n                Try for Free\n            </button>\n        </div>\n    </header>\n\n    <!-- Main Hero Section Wrapper -->\n    <main class=\"flex-1 flex items-center justify-center w-full min-h-screen\">\n\n        <!-- Artboard (Maintains precise aspect ratio and positioning for complex graphics) -->\n        <div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[1200px] aspect-auto lg:aspect-[16/9] isolate min-h-[600px] mt-20 lg:mt-0 pointer-events-none\">\n\n            <!-- Ambient Glow Backgrounds -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[30%] right-[10%] w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-emerald-500/[0.03] blur-[120px] rounded-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[40%] left-[20%] w-[400px] h-[400px] bg-cyan-500/[0.02] blur-[100px] rounded-full pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n\n            <!-- SVG Connection Lines Layer -->\n            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 1200 675\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\">\n                <defs>\n                    <filter id=\"glow\" x=\"-20%\" y=\"-20%\" width=\"140%\" height=\"140%\">\n                        <feGaussianBlur stdDeviation=\"4\" result=\"blur\"></feGaussianBlur>\n                        <feComposite in=\"SourceGraphic\" in2=\"blur\" operator=\"over\"></feComposite>\n                    </filter>\n                </defs>\n\n                <!-- Bottom Path connecting Left Nodes to Middle to Dial -->\n                <path d=\"M 160 480 L 480 480 Q 500 480 500 460 L 500 360 Q 500 340 520 340 L 900 340\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22252A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n\n                <!-- Mid Path extension (vertical drop) -->\n                <path d=\"M 700 340 L 700 400\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22252A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n\n                <!-- Top Path connecting to Dial -->\n                <path d=\"M 700 190 L 900 190\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22252A\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"></path>\n\n                <!-- Moving light particle path (Bottom) -->\n                <path id=\"anim-path-1\" d=\"M 280 480 L 480 480 Q 500 480 500 460 L 500 360 Q 500 340 520 340 L 600 340\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"transparent\" stroke-width=\"2\"></path>\n            </svg>\n\n            <!-- Animated Light Beams -->\n            <div id=\"particle-1\" class=\"absolute w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] opacity-0 z-10\" style=\"left: 0; top: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n            <div id=\"particle-2\" class=\"absolute w-1 h-1 bg-white rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.8)] opacity-0 z-10\" style=\"left: 0; top: 0; transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Left Content Section -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 z-20 flex flex-col justify-center w-full lg:w-[45%] pl-8 lg:pl-20 pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"pointer-events-auto\">\n                    <h1 class=\"text-6xl lg:text-[80px] leading-[1.1] text-white mb-5 max-w-[800px] font-geist font-light tracking-tighter\">\n                        Ship Globally in Milliseconds\n                    </h1>\n                    <p class=\"text-[#8e939a] text-[15px] leading-[1.6] max-w-[420px] mb-10 font-geist\">\n                        Distribute your applications worldwide instantly with our ultra-fast edge infrastructure. Everything you need to develop, monitor, and optimize your seamless digital experiences.\n                    </p>\n\n                    <!-- Glowing Pill Button -->\n                    <div class=\"relative inline-flex group cursor-pointer\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-400/20 rounded-full blur-md group-hover:bg-cyan-400/30 transition-all duration-500\"></div>\n                        <button class=\"relative bg-gradient-to-r from-[#d0f0f5] to-[#aee4eb] text-[#0d1f23] px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full text-[14px] font-medium flex items-center gap-2 ring-1 ring-white/20 shadow-[inset_0_1px_1px_rgba(255,255,255,0.6)] transition-all duration-300 hover:scale-[1.02] font-geist\">\n                            Initialize deployment\n                            <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" width=\"18\" height=\"18\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\"></iconify-icon>\n                        </button>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- UI Elements: Nodes & Badges -->\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left Node Group -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 flex items-center gap-2 pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc((160 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((480 / 675) * 100%); transform: translateY(-50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)] animate-pulse\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-rose-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(244,63,94,0.8)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-6 h-6 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_4px_12px_rgba(0,0,0,0.5)]\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(251,191,36,0.8)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Glowing connection point on bottom line -->\n            <div class=\"absolute w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-white rounded-full shadow-[0_0_10px_2px_rgba(255,255,255,0.5)] z-30\" style=\"left: calc((380 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((480 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\"></div>\n\n            <!-- Label: Network Active -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 bg-[#131518] border border-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-[11px] text-[#8e939a] shadow-lg tracking-wide pointer-events-auto font-geist\" style=\"left: calc((120 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((520 / 675) * 100%);\">\n                Network Active\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Middle Node Group -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 flex items-center gap-1.5 p-1.5 rounded-lg border border-emerald-500/10 bg-emerald-500/[0.02]\" style=\"left: calc((580 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((340 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%); box-shadow: 0 0 40px -10px rgba(16,185,129,0.3);\">\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(52,211,153,1)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"w-5 h-5 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center\">\n                    <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-amber-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(251,191,36,1)]\"></div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Vertical Label: State Replicated -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 bg-[#131518] border border-white/10 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-md text-[11px] text-[#8e939a] shadow-lg tracking-wide pointer-events-auto font-geist\" style=\"left: calc((700 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((250 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-90deg);\">\n                State Replicated\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Upper Node (Single) -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 w-5 h-5 bg-[#17191d] border border-[#2d3138] rounded-[4px] flex items-center justify-center shadow-lg\" style=\"left: calc((760 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((460 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-1 h-1 bg-emerald-400 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_6px_rgba(52,211,153,1)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Top Arc Entry Node -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-30 w-6 h-6 bg-[#151a17] border border-emerald-900/50 rounded flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(16,185,129,0.15)]\" style=\"left: calc((1035 / 1200) * 100%); top: calc((190 / 675) * 100%); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                <div class=\"w-1.5 h-1.5 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(16,185,129,0.8)]\"></div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- RIGHT SIDE: Complex Radial Dial Structure -->\n            <div class=\"absolute z-10 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 rounded-full pointer-events-none\" style=\"right: -250px; width: 800px; height: 800px;\">\n\n                <!-- Background Radial Gradient -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 rounded-full bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_center,rgba(0,0,0,0)_40%,rgba(16,18,21,0.8)_70%,rgba(16,18,21,1)_100%)]\"></div>\n\n                <!-- SVG for crisp geometric rings and dashes -->\n                <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 800\" class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full opacity-80\">\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"390\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#1d2025\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"290\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181a1f\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#0a0b0d\" stroke-width=\"100\"></circle>\n                    <circle id=\"tick-ring\" cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"230\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#16181c\" stroke-width=\"80\" stroke-dasharray=\"2 12\" style=\"transform-origin: center;\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"170\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22252a\" stroke-width=\"1\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"130\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22252a\" stroke-width=\"1\" stroke-dasharray=\"4 6\"></circle>\n                    <circle cx=\"400\" cy=\"400\" r=\"90\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#15171a\" stroke-width=\"2\"></circle>\n                </svg>\n\n                <!-- Center Glowing Core -->\n                <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-[120px] h-[120px] rounded-full bg-[#0a0b0d] border border-[#1a1c20] flex items-center justify-center shadow-[inset_0_0_20px_rgba(0,0,0,1)] pointer-events-auto\">\n                    <div id=\"core-spinner\" class=\"absolute inset-2 rounded-full border border-cyan-500/30 border-dashed border-t-cyan-400\" style=\"border-width: 1.5px;\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-[#121417] rounded-full border border-[#2a2d32] flex items-center justify-center relative\">\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[3px] rounded-full border border-emerald-500/20\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"absolute inset-[6px] rounded-full border border-emerald-500/10\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"w-2 h-2 bg-emerald-500 rounded-full shadow-[0_0_12px_3px_rgba(16,185,129,0.6)] z-10\"></div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Icons positioned along the arc -->\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#111317] border border-[#25282d] shadow-xl pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px - 230px * 0.34); top: calc(400px - 230px * 0.94); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-cyan-500/10 rounded-full blur-md\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hurricane-linear\" class=\"text-cyan-400 text-2xl relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#111317] border border-[#25282d] shadow-xl pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px - 230px * 0.76); top: calc(400px - 230px * 0.64); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-red-500/10 rounded-full blur-md\"></div>\n                    <span class=\"text-red-500 text-xl font-medium tracking-tighter relative z-10 font-geist\">G</span>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#111317] border border-[#25282d] shadow-xl pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px - 230px * 0.98); top: calc(400px - 230px * 0.17); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-amber-500/10 rounded-full blur-md\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:medical-kit-linear\" class=\"text-amber-400 text-2xl relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#111317] border border-[#25282d] shadow-xl pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px - 230px * 0.94); top: calc(400px + 230px * 0.34); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-pink-500/10 rounded-full blur-md\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:magnet-linear\" class=\"text-pink-500 text-2xl relative z-10 transform rotate-90\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-14 h-14 rounded-full bg-[#111317] border border-[#25282d] shadow-xl pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px - 230px * 0.64); top: calc(400px + 230px * 0.76); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-indigo-500/10 rounded-full blur-md\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:leaf-linear\" class=\"text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-br from-indigo-400 via-purple-400 to-rose-400 text-2xl relative z-10 block\" style=\"display: block;\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Empty circle container with newly added icon -->\n                <div class=\"absolute z-20 flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full bg-[#151113] border border-rose-900/30 shadow-[0_0_30px_rgba(225,29,72,0.15)] pointer-events-auto\" style=\"left: calc(400px + 230px * 0.17); top: calc(400px - 230px * 0.98); transform: translate(-50%, -50%);\">\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-rose-500/20 rounded-full blur-md animate-pulse\"></div>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:cpu-linear\" class=\"text-rose-400 text-[20px] relative z-10\"></iconify-icon>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <!-- Inline script for precise animations -->\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', () => {\n            const coreSpinner = document.getElementById('core-spinner');\n            const tickRing = document.getElementById('tick-ring');\n            let angle = 0;\n            let tickAngle = 0;\n\n            function animateRotations() {\n                angle += 0.5;\n                tickAngle -= 0.05;\n                if (coreSpinner) coreSpinner.style.transform = `rotate(${angle}deg)`;\n                if (tickRing) tickRing.style.transform = `rotate(${tickAngle}deg)`;\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateRotations);\n            }\n            requestAnimationFrame(animateRotations);\n\n            const path1 = document.getElementById('anim-path-1');\n            const particle1 = document.getElementById('particle-1');\n            const particle2 = document.getElementById('particle-2');\n\n            if (path1 && particle1 && particle2) {\n                const pathLength = path1.getTotalLength();\n                let progress1 = 0;\n                let progress2 = 0.5;\n\n                function animateParticles() {\n                    progress1 += 0.003;\n                    progress2 += 0.003;\n\n                    if (progress1 > 1) progress1 = 0;\n                    if (progress2 > 1) progress2 = 0;\n\n                    const pt1 = path1.getPointAtLength(progress1 * pathLength);\n                    const pt2 = path1.getPointAtLength(progress2 * pathLength);\n\n                    const opacity1 = Math.sin(progress1 * Math.PI);\n                    const opacity2 = Math.sin(progress2 * Math.PI);\n\n                    particle1.style.left = `${(pt1.x / 1200) * 100}%`;\n                    particle1.style.top = `${(pt1.y / 675) * 100}%`;\n                    particle1.style.opacity = (opacity1 * opacity1).toFixed(2);\n\n                    particle2.style.left = `${(pt2.x / 1200) * 100}%`;\n                    particle2.style.top = `${(pt2.y / 675) * 100}%`;\n                    particle2.style.opacity = (opacity2 * opacity2).toFixed(2);\n\n                    requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n                }\n                requestAnimationFrame(animateParticles);\n            }\n        });\n    </script>\n\n</body></html>", "preview_file_name": "vortex-global-scale-1.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/staff-featured-2026-05-22/vortex-global-scale-1.jpg", "source_name": "vortex-global-scale-1-DESIGN.md", "views": 371, "forks": 10, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-22T07:58:12.433844+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T11:48:44.325731+00:00"}